/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Build-time source data for tools/. These are large public-domain downloads
# (Natural Earth GeoJSON, GeoNames cities500) that the build scripts fetch on
# demand; the generated assets are committed instead. See tools/README.md.
/tools/data/
